What is the output of the following Java program re-throwing an exception after inspection?
```java
public class RethrowDemo {
    static void process() {
        try {
            throw new RuntimeException("Alpha");
        } catch (RuntimeException e) {
            System.out.print("Intercepted ");
            throw e;
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            process();
        } catch (RuntimeException e) {
            System.out.print(e.getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

