What is the output of the following Java program combining a throw statement, try-catch, and a finally block?
```java
public class ThrowFinallyCombo {
    static String assess() {
        try {
            System.out.print("1 ");
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Bad");
        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
            System.out.print("2 ");
            throw new IllegalStateException("Escalate");
        } finally {
            System.out.print("3 ");
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            assess();
        } catch (IllegalStateException e) {
            System.out.print("4");
        }
    }
}
```
